  "limits": "Initial live native rows at one X11 scale; the fixture helper was closed before login. The rows.json files contain real public row Name/Description/rect/showing, but atspi.json files only contain a failed full-tree collection placeholder and do not establish a complete tree capture. No claim of live AT-SPI role-change/permission-revocation delivery, Orca speech, all group keyboard paths or HiDPI coverage. Permanent tests query native accessible cells at initialization and canonical model roles after later updates because an inactive offscreen bridge does not deliver model resets. No cache deletion, forced accessibility activation or timeout relaxation. Source hashes alone are not compilation provenance; the complete original gate has its own manifest."
